0..79 Comment "//! Doc comments and the `doc` attribute, after the intra-doc links of rustdoc."
80..157 Comment "//! A `[name]` in either resolves to a declaration of the source. A `[label]`"
158..235 Comment "//! resolves to a footer line `[label]: target` at the end of its run. A link"
236..276 Comment "//! that resolves to neither is refused."
